**Sample Size and Precision {#s3f}
---------------------------

• Number of wells per plate (typically 6--24) - The mean ± standard deviation (SD) of the positive control (8 replicates per sample) per well was 52.2±1.9. For samples and positive controls, this value was 107.6±6.6. The number of positive controls (8 replicates per sample) per well will be 6.5 per plate.
